Package: pearcircle-seeder
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: PeerLoom LLC <noreply@peerloomllc.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, libc6
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Homepage: https://peerloomllc.com
Description: PearCircle blind-seeder background service
 Keeps a PearCircle circle's encrypted data online when no member device is.
 Runs the blind-seeder worklet as a systemd user service and serves a
 localhost monitoring dashboard at http://127.0.0.1:8730 for enrolling
 circles and watching replication. The seeder is "blind": it stores and
 serves a circle's blocks without ever being able to decrypt them.
